  "label": "White Supremacist Racist Ideology",
  "description": "The meme is rooted in white supremacist ideology, which seeks to justify racial hierarchy and dominance by portraying white people as superior and Black people as inferior or 'uncivilized.' The meme's intent to demean Black people by portraying them as the 'superior' force that 'taught' white people to stand upright is a classic example of this ideology.",
